      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight that dogs thoroughly enjoy attending daycare and boarding stays at this facility. Reviewers observe that high-energy puppies and sensitive rescue dogs receive individualized attention, returning home tired, emotionally balanced, and excited for future play sessions."
      }
    },
