        "en": "Substantial behavioral and obedience progress"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report clear improvements in their dogs' manners following day training and board-and-train courses. Multiple reviews cite success in curbing severe leash pulling, decreasing reactivity toward strangers, and developing reliable recall into well-mannered companions."
      }
